  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@pla_is_me\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811663/youtube_icon_bcbanf.png\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fEsvPsnqJpz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811736/discord_icon_bg_rp4omx.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fpla_is_me\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761815764/kofi_icon_bg_sy3foi.png\" alt=\"Ko‑fi\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/PlaIsMe\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811682/github_icon_bg_wmtjei.png\" alt=\"Github\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>Annoying Villagers: Herobrine Invasion</strong>&nbsp;主要添加了靈感來自 Mr. FudgeMonkeyz《煩人的村民》動畫系列的自訂生物與武器，包含 Herobrine、村民斥候以及多種 NPC 玩家生物。此外，它還強化了玩家 NPC 的 AI 行為，使其更具動態性與挑戰性。</p>\n<p>安裝此模組後，你的遊戲體驗將變得<strong>極度困難</strong>，就像動畫中一樣。準備好迎接激烈的戰鬥與更聰明的敵人吧！</p>\n<p style=\"color:#fc0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center\">⚠️ 如果依賴項出現問題，請安裝此整合包<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/annoying-villagers-full-dependencies-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Annoying Villagers Full Dependencies Pack</a></p>\n<h2>新事件</h2>\n<h3>Herobrine 入侵</h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Herobrine 複製體將自然生成於遊戲中。</p>\n<p>在夜晚，Herobrine Greg 可能會觸發事件並召喚<strong>高階 Herobrine 複製體</strong>，例如<strong>Null</strong>、<strong>陰影 Herobrine</strong> 與<strong>精英 Herobrine</strong>。在此事件期間，他會隨機召喚<strong>1 至 3 個高階 Herobrine</strong> 以及<strong>1 至 3 個普通 Herobrine 複製體</strong>。</p>\n<p>你可以在事件發生前追蹤並擊殺 Herobrine Greg 來阻止該事件。不過，若你在夜晚試圖擊殺他，他會召喚 Herobrine 複製體並逃離；若在白天嘗試擊殺他，他則會召喚低階 Herobrine 複製體並逃離。</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5zEO1nUtqw8\" width=\"750\" height=\"421\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>新 Herobrine</h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3>Herobrine 複製體</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_aeb69dd6-ae41-426c-9364-40a91b138346.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>陰影 Herobrine 複製體</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_65b14c82-b797-469f-8969-198d8f007b1c.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>Herobrine Chris</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_942ffd9c-c676-40e5-89a8-536e666a8b12.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>Herobrine Greg</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_4718124d-b8d8-41af-ab63-2fe57ed67683.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>Herobrine 7</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_2930c0b0-bda3-4111-9473-851a8cd7605f.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>裝甲 Herobrine</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_88083d7d-f713-41a2-8446-4767905fcd2a.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>低階 Herobrine 複製體</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_b30c2328-838b-4bbe-8976-3342465743b1.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>Null<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_435dddc4-21a7-4284-a78c-4fadfd25934d.png\"></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>陰影 Herobrine</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_7c6dfa40-e740-4654-89fa-71f7699d1f74.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>長戟 Herobrine</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_cde8a48a-20bc-4dbd-8e2d-c5332fff3574.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>死神 Herobrine</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_69dcdd19-6b63-4b57-b985-c96baa0afef9.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>劍士 Herobrine</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_519b4e9f-604b-4497-9740-7b2e88e8dc35.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>大錘 Herobrine</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_4392fc48-ecc8-4892-adf8-d0055ea7fd73.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>神盾 Herobrine</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_bb7915ec-4577-4671-a3ff-fc6fa4881bb9.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>新不死族生物</h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3>藍魔</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_2f26fa7e-afbb-4c04-9ba4-b7cbdc60c1bf.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>新 NPC</h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3>史蒂夫</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_b498ed8a-a22a-423c-a4ee-ccaeeec28847.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>憤怒的史蒂夫</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_6bcaceea-c208-43ca-a865-c7dc8281db47.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>艾莉克斯</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_b60f66e0-bb48-4d1d-bdcb-2e1fda4d1cfd.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>克里斯</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_b828762c-05e0-4910-b558-6f6a121587b2.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>新村民</h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3>村民斥候</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_8d72261b-c0a8-4cce-aa79-79af1dece997.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>斥候隊長</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_aec36512-4fac-4d67-997b-6f91bfdfbfea.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>村民將軍</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_04ff7759-07c6-4e27-a3f1-9a9011cf2706.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>新武器</h2>\n<p>本模組新增了來自《煩人的村民》系列的 90 多款新武器。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_26389eb6-6460-4e7e-92e5-81e17e0b0352.png\" width=\"370\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_01cae0dc-4f4c-48ee-bc31-18524832a172.png\" width=\"370\"></p>\n<h3>Herobrine 武器</h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>終界長戟</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_04eb6b5c-1bc4-4d27-8d7b-9ed87118e426.png\"></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/y0D39bcKwkE\" width=\"750\" height=\"421\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>終界殺手鐮刀</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_6b144a29-2a7a-44f1-b41b-471d4b850398.png\"></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/OztMf7HetDU\" width=\"750\" height=\"421\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>魔性電壓裂解者</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_da741e26-7264-4437-9c90-e65d81b76cfd.png\"></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qFuQYlqRyD4\" width=\"750\" height=\"421\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>黑曜石大錘</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_3bea8189-2f19-40af-a367-04d734e8a6fe.png\"></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/K3UNFxRCEk4\" width=\"750\" height=\"421\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>終界神盾</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_9969f1e8-634d-4a53-8238-5bcca89a0d9a.png\"></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/G8ko8FIhGCc\" width=\"750\" height=\"421\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Null 武器</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_a78628a8-ab03-42f9-b7a5-ae3b317c06ef.png\"></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4FJyCfgwRTM\" width=\"750\" height=\"421\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>黑曜石武器</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_8356fb91-26b2-4cf6-94cf-f9f4157ea9c6.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>基岩武器</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_ebd54e04-d004-4885-a5cc-0c0e3d302541.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>陰影黑曜石劍</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_0519c90e-b727-43a4-af37-064bd8ec4559.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>陰影黑曜石柱</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_d9a66b9b-1bda-4be8-989e-8dcbc1bf2983.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Herobrine 的終界之眼</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_fc6b1ea7-10e7-4429-91b5-72098d1c7b03.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>傳奇武器</h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>傳奇劍</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_6f4f7585-42d0-4ca8-bd30-97cb69e9f844.png\"></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qjygb602kNk\" width=\"750\" height=\"421\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>藍魔三叉戟</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_35052893-cd66-4e2c-b8e6-ac355ab2ff37.png\"></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IwnKCvGm9Jo\" width=\"750\" height=\"421\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>其他武器</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FQYySnT5O-8\" width=\"750\" height=\"421\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>伍皮劍</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_40175caa-7e3c-4b0e-bf5a-74204879527f.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>大劍</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_fd9b44e1-af54-4630-a2bf-3ffb537991cd.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>黑焰劍</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_c232e46c-4d41-4f47-91ae-6994dd0f8bba.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>藍焰劍</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_3d46a220-b834-4405-941a-652d564e51d1.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>屠刀劍 / 森塔諾斯之劍</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_d9905466-e78c-4a31-98ce-3743983c0061.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>克勞之劍</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_c2341a09-fdd8-40ed-a67f-880cd57d089d.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>鑽石吸引劍</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_89ca7caa-0740-4efc-af05-fee296228734.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>鑽石爆破劍</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_adbbf0e8-fce1-436f-bb63-a8da5b306b46.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>駭客劍</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_93fb8f96-c3ad-454f-8b40-47947dc67910.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>鑽石戰刃</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_8dfb5ab6-23ee-4a70-aaa6-907062d48b93.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>鑽石萊瓦汀</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_7ee0f546-588a-4a35-982a-8bb727792694.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>長彎刀</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_47ae77f3-a3ac-412d-a075-360fd60ac551.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>長劍</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_2fe5cd9f-4e62-455d-975b-ea536b99d0a9.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>破損長劍</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_6b2c153b-7854-4c08-8148-d47680fff34d.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>巨劍</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_bbcd4970-dd97-42ec-9fd9-c13c8fe5ab56.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>劍 / 騎士劍</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_1c32a89c-4bfa-4769-b450-226972aab8bf.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>大地之斧<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_d833469b-dec9-43d4-8e74-e54032c3e3ae.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>紅斧</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_3f589f5e-e466-4aa7-a2b8-0d600fa970a9.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>鑽石戰斧</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_2fb8b226-c13d-4da8-9ec7-63244c4ceaa8.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>巨型下界合金斧</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_b294c897-06af-4951-bb49-d57601fdd679.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>毀滅者戰斧</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_d4fae779-dec6-4669-b2ca-2e25d536fa16.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>巨斧</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_1fee0d24-86ea-4e20-9ed2-bf33a8e6cde6.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>戟</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_905fa13b-bf0c-4577-8b29-64c7194d3117.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>殺戮者莎曼莎之斧</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_6648cb32-7232-4808-bc37-94a2e41cb457.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>短刀</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_e6bdb7d8-01d8-40bb-b7c2-cce527d9a28a.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>鑽石臂刃</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_f8323d7e-b1e6-4afc-8be8-0edf83bc533a.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>月刃<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_8394d12b-e6bd-43b7-898f-d642e2554b82.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>鑽石爪</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_4c1fab92-df00-4026-9068-596a273454d0.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>長矛</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_3cf28a05-85b4-4e76-b84e-17b433c1c33d.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>雙頭長矛 / 雙刃 / 雙戟</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_17fcaac4-52ae-4484-9b1e-a9e2e1dc647a.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>鐮刀</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_f10a8c12-4c20-4417-8ec8-c72be6af2649.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>黑痕劍</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_a75d3459-f631-41bf-832d-5d0472e3c581.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>工作台</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_4146b7e7-06db-449b-9724-b40f0ce1858a.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>木門</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_292caf0b-49e3-48cb-bcbf-94f82282f1e8.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>活板門</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1308998/description_508a9662-64df-47b7-8afa-06f4e9521a41.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>梯子</p>\n<p><img src=\"https